From: itskenny0 <0@kenny.cat>
Subject: [PATCH] Fix MT6765 DSI command handling

Copy RX data before acknowledging it. Wait for command completion in
process context. Bound transfers, preserve errors and validate packets.
Serialize commands with power changes and enable IRQ delivery only when
clocks and lanes are ready. Synchronize shutdown before stopping clocks.

